      "description": "Native Button ghost variant with the workspace size.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-ghost-small\">Back to files</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-ghost-small{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--dsw-font-family);height:28px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:var(--dsw-radius-sm);font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-primary);background:transparent;}@media(hover:hover){.ds-button-ghost-small:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--dsw-alias-interactive-bg-hover);}}.ds-button-ghost-small:focus-visible{outline-color:var(--dsw-alias-state-business-primary);outline-width:2px;}.ds-button-ghost-small:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed;}.ds-button-ghost-small:active:not(:disabled){background:var(--dsw-alias-interactive-bg-active);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Header icon action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-icon-header",
      "description": "Header refresh and overflow use 28px targets matching native small buttons; row icons remain 34px. Native portaled icon hints sit below, end-aligned with a 2px gap, wait 350ms on hover, and appear immediately on keyboard focus. Overflow shows localized More actions while keeping resource-specific accessible names; open menus and disabled actions suppress their hints. Batch reindex retains bottom placement and the native default gap.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-header-icon\" aria-label=\"Actions for “Personal notes”\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M3 9C3.55228 9 4 8.55228 4 8C4 7.44772 3.55228 7 3 7C2.44772 7 2 7.44772 2 8C2 8.55228 2.44772 9 3 9Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><path d=\"M8 9C8.55228 9 9 8.55228 9 8C9 7.44772 8.55228 7 8 7C7.44772 7 7 7.44772 7 8C7 8.55228 7.44772 9 8 9Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><path d=\"M13 9C13.5523 9 14 8.55228 14 8C14 7.44772 13.5523 7 13 7C12.4477 7 12 7.44772 12 8C12 8.55228 12.4477 9 13 9Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-header-icon{display:inline-flex;flex:0 0 28px;width:28px;height:28px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:var(--dsw-radius-sm);background:transparent;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary);cursor:pointer;}@media(hover:hover){.ds-header-icon:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--dsw-alias-interactive-bg-hover);color:var(--dsw-alias-label-primary);}}.ds-header-icon:focus-visible{outline:var(--dsw-focus-ring-width) solid var(--dsw-focus-ring-color,var(--dsw-alias-state-business-primary));}.ds-header-icon:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Search field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "search-field",
      "description": "Labeled search wrapper shared by directory and materials.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M6.58727 11.8586C9.55061 11.8586 11.9529 9.45637 11.9529 6.49304C11.9529 3.5297 9.55061 1.12744 6.58727 1.12744C3.62394 1.12744 1.22168 3.5297 1.22168 6.49304C1.22168 9.45637 3.62394 11.8586 6.58727 11.8586Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\"></path><path d=\"M10.2991 10.3933L14.7783 14.8725\" stroke=\"currentColor\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" aria-label=\"Search knowledge bases\" placeholder=\"Search knowledge bases…\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:min(280px,100%);height:34px;padding:0 10px;border:.5px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2);border-radius:7px;background:var(--dsw-alias-bg-base);color:var(--dsw-alias-label-tertiary);}.ds-search input{flex:1;min-width:0;height:100%;padding:0;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-primary);font:13px/20px var(--dsw-font-family);}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:var(--dsw-alias-label-tertiary);}.ds-search:focus-within{border-color:var(--dsw-alias-border-l4);color:var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Scope tabs",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Directory scope selection uses native SegmentedControl geometry and behavior.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-scopes\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Knowledge base scope\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ds-scope-indicator\"></span><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">All</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Personal</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Department</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">Company</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-scopes{--dsh-segment-count:4;--dsh-segment-index:0;position:relative;display:inline-grid;grid-auto-flow:column;grid-auto-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:2px;padding:4px;border-radius:var(--dsw-radius-md);background:var(--dsw-alias-interactive-bg-hover);}.ds-scope-indicator{position:absolute;top:4px;left:4px;width:calc((100% - 8px - 2px * (var(--dsh-segment-count) - 1)) / var(--dsh-segment-count));height:calc(100% - 8px);border:0;border-radius:var(--dsw-radius-sm);background:var(--dsw-alias-bg-layer-1);box-shadow:var(--dsw-elevation-soft);transform:translateX(calc(var(--dsh-segment-index) * (100% + 2px)));transition:transform 160ms ease;pointer-events:none;}.ds-scopes button{position:relative;z-index:1;height:28px;padding:0 16px;border:0;border-radius:var(--dsw-radius-sm);background:transparent;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary);font:500 13px/20px var(--dsw-font-family);white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:color 120ms ease;}.ds-scopes button[aria-selected=\"true\"]{color:var(--dsw-alias-label-primary);}@media(hover:hover){.ds-scopes button:hover:not(:disabled){color:var(--dsw-alias-label-primary);}}.ds-scopes button:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.4;}.ds-scopes button:focus-visible{outline:var(--dsw-focus-ring-width) solid var(--dsw-focus-ring-color,var(--dsw-alias-state-business-primary));outline-offset:-2px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-scope-indicator,.ds-scopes button{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Library browsing control",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Library-root folder/all-files selection shares the wrapping search and filter toolbar; folders omit this control.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-browse\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Browse knowledge base\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ds-browse-indicator\"></span><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">Folders</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">All files in this knowledge base</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-browse{--dsh-segment-count:2;--dsh-segment-index:0;position:relative;display:inline-grid;grid-auto-flow:column;grid-auto-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:2px;padding:4px;border-radius:var(--dsw-radius-md);background:var(--dsw-alias-interactive-bg-hover);}.ds-browse-indicator{position:absolute;top:4px;left:4px;width:calc((100% - 8px - 2px * (var(--dsh-segment-count) - 1)) / var(--dsh-segment-count));height:calc(100% - 8px);border:0;border-radius:var(--dsw-radius-sm);background:var(--dsw-alias-bg-layer-1);box-shadow:var(--dsw-elevation-soft);transform:translateX(calc(var(--dsh-segment-index) * (100% + 2px)));transition:transform 160ms ease;pointer-events:none;}.ds-browse button{position:relative;z-index:1;height:28px;padding:0 10px;border:0;border-radius:var(--dsw-radius-sm);background:transparent;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary);font:500 12px/20px var(--dsw-font-family);white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:color 120ms ease;}.ds-browse button[aria-selected=\"true\"]{color:var(--dsw-alias-label-primary);}@media(hover:hover){.ds-browse button:hover:not(:disabled){color:var(--dsw-alias-label-primary);}}.ds-browse button:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.4;}.ds-browse button:focus-visible{outline:var(--dsw-focus-ring-width) solid var(--dsw-focus-ring-color,var(--dsw-alias-state-business-primary));outline-offset:-2px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-browse-indicator,.ds-browse button{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Library card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "library-card",
      "description": "Icon/title grid with an optional real description and a separate scope/owner footer.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-library\"><button class=\"ds-library-open\"><span class=\"ds-library-icon\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M13.1967 5.1869C13.7232 4.77378 14.0003 4.30517 14.0001 3.82819C14.0003 3.3512 13.7232 2.88259 13.1967 2.46947C12.6702 2.05635 11.9128 1.71328 11.0006 1.47475C10.0885 1.23621 9.05371 1.11062 8.00039 1.1106C6.94707 1.11057 5.9123 1.23612 5.00009 1.47461C4.08742 1.71301 3.32948 2.05604 2.80249 2.46919C2.2755 2.88235 1.99805 3.35106 1.99805 3.82819C1.99805 4.30531 2.2755 4.77402 2.80249 5.18718C3.32948 5.60033 4.08742 5.94336 5.00009 6.18176C5.9123 6.42025 6.94707 6.5458 8.00039 6.54578C9.05371 6.54575 10.0885 6.42016 11.0006 6.18163C11.9128 5.94309 12.6702 5.60002 13.1967 5.1869Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\"></path><path d=\"M2 3.80371V11.7848\" stroke=\"currentColor\"></path><path d=\"M14 3.80371V11.7848\" stroke=\"currentColor\"></path><path d=\"M2 7.81396C2 8.60524 2.63214 9.36411 3.75736 9.92363C4.88258 10.4832 6.4087 10.7975 8 10.7975C9.5913 10.7975 11.1174 10.4832 12.2426 9.92363C13.3679 9.36411 14 8.60524 14 7.81396\" stroke=\"currentColor\"></path><path d=\"M2 11.7847C2 12.6081 2.63214 13.3977 3.75736 13.98C4.88258 14.5622 6.4087 14.8893 8 14.8893C9.5913 14.8893 11.1174 14.5622 12.2426 13.98C13.3679 13.3977 14 12.6081 14 11.7847\" stroke=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span><h2>Personal notes</h2></button><footer>Personal · Library owner</footer></article>",
      "css": ".ds-library{display:flex;width:min(280px,100%);min-width:0;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2);border-radius:12px;background:var(--dsw-alias-bg-base);color:var(--dsw-alias-label-primary);overflow:hidden;font-family:var(--dsw-font-family);}.ds-library-open{display:grid;flex:1;grid-template-columns:32px minmax(0,1fr);align-content:start;align-items:center;gap:8px 12px;width:100%;min-width:0;padding:18px 20px 14px;border:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;text-align:left;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;}.ds-library-icon{display:grid;width:32px;height:32px;place-items:center;border-radius:6px;background:var(--dsw-alias-bg-module-platform);color:var(--dsw-alias-brand-primary);}.ds-library h2{width:100%;margin:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;}.ds-library p{grid-column:2;display:-webkit-box;margin:0;overflow:hidden;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;-webkit-line-clamp:2;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary);font-size:13px;line-height:22px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-library footer{display:flex;min-height:44px;align-items:center;margin:0 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l2);color:var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary);font-size:12px;}.ds-library:focus-within{border-color:var(--dsw-alias-border-l4);}.ds-library-open:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--dsw-alias-brand-primary);outline-offset:-3px;border-radius:11px;}@media(hover:hover){.ds-library:hover{border-color:var(--dsw-alias-border-l4);}.ds-library-open:hover{background:var(--dsw-alias-interactive-bg-hover);}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Folder navigation row",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-row",
      "description": "Current folder uses neutral hover fill and an explicit current-page attribute.",
      "html": "<nav aria-label=\"Folders\"><button class=\"ds-folder\" aria-current=\"page\"><span>Policies</span></button><button class=\"ds-folder\"><span>Reference</span></button></nav>",
